# .config/
#
# This directory holds tool configuration overrides.
# By default it's empty — cpm uses built-in defaults.
#
# To get all default configs as files:
#
#   cpm eject
#
# This generates: .clang-format, Doxyfile, .cppcheck, etc.
# Edit what you need, delete what you don't.
# If a config file is absent, cpm falls back to its defaults.
